WEBVTT

00:09:28.950 --> 00:09:31.307
they're going to deliver.

00:09:31.307 --> 00:09:33.270
So a couple of years ago, I thought I would take

00:09:33.270 --> 00:09:36.499
some time out and speak to that gigantic database

00:09:36.499 --> 00:09:38.706
and ask it,

00:09:38.706 --> 00:09:40.598
why do some people prefer one country

00:09:40.598 --> 00:09:42.361
more than another?

00:09:42.361 --> 00:09:43.900
And the answer that the database gave me

00:09:43.900 --> 00:09:45.596
completely staggered me.

00:09:45.596 --> 00:09:47.785
It was 6.8.

00:09:47.785 --> 00:09:49.874
I haven't got time to explain in detail.

00:09:49.874 --> 00:09:52.230
Basically what it told me was —

00:09:52.230 --> 00:09:56.452
(Laughter) (Applause) —

00:09:56.452 --> 00:10:00.684
the kinds of countries we prefer are good countries.